924 0 obj
  << /ActualText (AI generates code at a faster pace than human reviewers can verify\054 so an automated system is important to increase reviewers\031 efficiency and enhance review quality\056 Most related works focus on a single LLM combined with different prompting\054 retrievalaugmented generation\054 or tool\055calling techniques\056\nWe propose LLMCR\054 an intelligent multi\055LLM code review system that focuses on validating Java pull requests and delivering comprehensive code reviews\054 helping reviewers evaluate code more efficiently\056 )
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 925 0 R
     /Pg 918 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

