926 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Overview of the stage\055based code review system\056 For InterpretationLM\054 PlanningLM\054 and SummaryLM\054 we use Gemini\0553\0561\055flash\055lite\056 For ComputationLM and RetrievalLM\054 we use Nvidia\055Nemotron\0553\0554B to reduce cost\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 927 0 R
     /Pg 918 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
